<section class="installation-page" style="padding: 60px 0 100px; background: #12110c;">
  <div class="page-width">
    
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">HOME</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700;">10-MINUTE DIY INSTALLATION GUIDE</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.25em; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 4px 12px; background: rgba(255, 217, 0, 0.1); border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
        ZERO WIRE SPLICING • 100% PLUG & PLAY
      </span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px); font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        LED BULB <span style="color: var(--color-primary);">INSTALLATION GUIDE</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
        Electro NightEye LED conversion kits are engineered to 1:1 OEM halogen filament specs. Follow our 4-step guide to achieve razor-sharp road illumination in under 10 minutes per headlight.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Step Installation Process Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      
      <div class="glass-panel" style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px 24px; position: relative;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--color-primary); color: #12110c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">POWER OFF & UNPLUG</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          Turn off your vehicle's ignition and headlights. Allow factory halogen bulbs to cool down. Disconnect the OEM wire harness clip and remove the rubber dust cap.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel" style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px 24px; position: relative;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--color-primary); color: #12110c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">REMOVE OLD BULBS</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          Unclip the factory spring latch or twist counter-clockwise to remove the stock halogen bulb. Store your old bulbs as emergency spares in your glovebox.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel" style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px 24px; position: relative;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--color-primary); color: #12110c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">INSERT & LOCK COLLAR</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          Insert the Electro NightEye LED into the socket collar. Ensure the CSP LED chips face 3 o'clock and 9 o'clock horizontally for an optimal razor-sharp cutoff beam.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel" style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px 24px; position: relative;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--color-primary); color: #12110c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          04
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">CONNECT & TEST</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          Plug the Canbus-integrated harness directly into your OEM socket. Replace the factory dust seal, power on vehicle headlights, and enjoy 15,000 LM daylight clarity.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Canbus & Beam Alignment Pro Tips -->
    <div class="glass-panel" style="background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 40px; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 28px;">tips_and_updates</span>
        <span>PRO-TECH INSTALLATION & ALIGNMENT TIPS</span>
      </h2>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; md:grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7;">
        <div>
          <h4 style="color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Horizontal Chip Orientation (3 & 9 O'clock)</h4>
          <p>
            For reflector and projector housings, always ensure the dual-sided CSP LED chips are oriented left and right (horizontal). This matches OEM filament geometry and produces a clean cutoff line that never glares opposing traffic.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 style="color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">Non-Polarity Plug & Play Connection</h4>
          <p>
            Electro NightEye LEDs feature non-polarity intelligent driver chips. If you plug in the connector and it doesn't illuminate immediately, simply flip the plug 180 degrees to align with inverted aftermarket wiring.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to action -->
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/products/electro-nighteye-led" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 16px 36px; font-size: 14px;">
        <span>EXPLORE NIGHTEYE LED KITS</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined font-black">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Installation Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
